{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yd0ny1wb","slide":3,"name":"TextBox 1001","text":"KumbhRakshak: Nashik-Trimbakeshwar Safety Prototype\nThe 2027 Simhastha will need clear place context and timely information across ghats, routes and facilities.\nKumbhRakshak brings monitoring signals and response tools into one command-centre website.\nWhat the Platform Shows\nAn illustrative 3D guide links Nashik and Trimbakeshwar landmarks to the relevant crowd, map, camera, shelter and incident portals.\nThe present build is a demonstration with simulated operational data. It is not an official navigation or emergency-response system.","textPreview":"KumbhRakshak: Nashik-Trimbakeshwar Safety Prototype | The 2027 Simhastha will need clear place context and timely information across ghat...","textChars":540,"textLines":6,"bbox":[141.73,234.12,1081.36,459.84]}
