{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t0zuh0zm","slide":9,"name":"TextBox 1012","text":"Data Flow\nPlace, camera and public-report inputs are organized into location-linked views.\nThe system groups observations and presents claims with supporting or missing evidence.\nRisk indicators support review; a human operator remains responsible for any action.\nApproved information can then be displayed in the dashboard and advisory workflow.","textPreview":"Data Flow | Place, camera and public-report inputs are organized into location-linked views. | The system groups observations and present...","textChars":346,"textLines":5,"bbox":[141.73,358.01,1081.36,335.96]}
